        "content": "## WF-02 Script Builder\nNormalises narration, splits sections/paragraphs/sentences, tags characters and locations → episode_script.json. AUTO_CHAIN continues through story validation, TTS and mandatory audio QC.\n\nPOST /webhook/ass/wf02-script\nHeader: as configured in 'ASS Webhook Auth'\nBody: {\"episode_id\": 1, \"run\": \"r1\", \"chat_id\": 123}\n\nIdempotent: same episode_id+run → same job.",
        "height": 260,
